1
00:01,389 --> 00:14,330
수의자의 식민지로 만들려는 기도를 분쇄할 일대 구국 대책을 강구하지 않는다면 우리는 전조선 인민들과 후손들에게 대하여 전투에 있으실 수 없는 죄를 지닌다는 것을 각오해야 하겠습니다.

2
00:31,390 --> 00:37,689
The invasion of the Republic of Korea was a direct challenge to the principles of the United Nations.

3
00:38,890 --> 00:42,549
That challenge was met by an overwhelming response.

4
00:47,369 --> 00:59,810
in that far off land could prove once again that only courage and sacrifice can keep freedom alive upon the earth.
